Abstract = {Rhetorical games are not the only tools of construction of political
   power. However, they constitute an indicator of hegemonic struggle
   strategies, which has been developed by the political actors. The
   present paper focuses on the linguistic elements of president's Nestor
   Kirchner's hegemonic strategy. The reconstruction of his discursive
   production allows us to better comprehend the process of hegemonic
   reconfiguration produced in recent times in Argentina.},
