Pages = {76-89},
Abstract = {In this paper, we address the problem of generating good quality grids
   on very irregular regions, and propose a measure for both the quality of
   the generated grids and the difficulty of the problem, as well as an
   efficient algorithm based on the minimization of area functionals to
   solve it. Using the proposed measure, a preliminary classification of
   some standard test regions is presented.},
