Number = {1},
Pages = {67-72},
Month = {NOV 1},
Abstract = {The effect of the mobile charge concentration on the electron-phonon
   coupling constant, the band overlapping parameter and the isotopic
   coefficient is studied for a two-dimensional superconductor in a
   two-band model. This model is applied to describe the relation between
   the superconducting transition and the carrier density in CuO2 layered
   superconductors, within the BCS framework. The experimental data for
   doping-induced charge in layered Hg-based cuprates are used to obtain
   numerical results. (c) 2006 Published by Elsevier B.V.},
