   introduced in {[}1]. We prove that the collection R-conat of all
   conatural classes of left modules over a ring R is a set, and it is a
   boolean lattice. Afterwards we study relationships between some lattices
   of module classes: R-conat and R-tors, R-her and R-quot. As a
   consequence of the developed theory we obtain characterizations of left
