   Univ Nacl Autonoma Mexico, Fac Ciencias, Lab Edafol, Mexico City 04510, DF, Mexico.
   RAS, Inst Biol, Karelian Res Ctr, Petrozavodsk 185610, Russia.
   INCA, Havana, Cuba.},
